{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >core gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player control: Use the keyboard directional keys (\u2191\u2193\u2190\u2192) to control the movement of King Zhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Zhou and each of his concubines have a number displayed above their heads (shown in the center of the picture).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time a concubine is successfully captured, King Zhou's number only increases by 1 (the score is calculated based on the number of concubines captured).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concubine logic:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep 6 concubines on the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After catching a concubine, immediately refresh a new concubine, keeping the total number at 6.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement mechanism: All concubines move randomly within the screen, bounce back when they touch the boundary, and periodically change their movement direction randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules for capturing concubines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Zhou can only capture concubines whose numbers are less than or equal to King Zhou's number (friendly concubines).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consorts with numbers greater than the number of King Zhou (enemy concubines, red logic) cannot be caught. Touching them will end the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent color change: After each capture, all concubines update the color of their heads based on the current number of King Zhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level system: For every 10 captured concubines, their movement speed will slightly increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game end and restart:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When King Zhou encounters a concubine whose number is greater than his own, the game ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the game ends, you can choose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press R to restart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Q to exit the game</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126710?t=1761444322","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126710?t=1761444322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126710/56e84281494336fb4c572a58cafe94492242f559/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761444322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126710/56e84281494336fb4c572a58cafe94492242f559/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761444322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >core gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player control: Use the keyboard directional keys (\u2191\u2193\u2190\u2192) to control the movement of King Zhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Zhou and each of his concubines have a number displayed above their heads (shown in the center of the picture).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time a concubine is successfully captured, King Zhou's number only increases by 1 (the score is calculated based on the number of concubines captured).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concubine logic:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep 6 concubines on the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After catching a concubine, immediately refresh a new concubine, keeping the total number at 6.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement mechanism: All concubines move randomly within the screen, bounce back when they touch the boundary, and periodically change their movement direction randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules for capturing concubines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Zhou can only capture concubines whose numbers are less than or equal to King Zhou's number (friendly concubines).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consorts with numbers greater than the number of King Zhou (enemy concubines, red logic) cannot be caught. Touching them will end the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent color change: After each capture, all concubines update the color of their heads based on the current number of King Zhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level system: For every 10 captured concubines, their movement speed will slightly increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game end and restart:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When King Zhou encounters a concubine whose number is greater than his own, the game ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the game ends, you can choose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press R to restart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Q to exit the game</p>","developers":["\u7ea3\u738b\u6293\u5983"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126710/ab82dc6e654b2194b320341c77287ea2b071de6c/header.jpg?t=1761444322","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved. For cooperation, please contact the official website<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4126710/66612730/c30cf87c21ed4a9512c8d7b2b0fec918d7a72b8b/1761043194/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761444320","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4126710/66612730/c30cf87c21ed4a9512c8d7b2b0fec918d7a72b8b/1761043194/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761444320","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4126710/66612730/c30cf87c21ed4a9512c8d7b2b0fec918d7a72b8b/1761043194/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761444320","id":257220451,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220451/movie480.mp4?t=1761444320","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220451/movie_max.mp4?t=1761444320"},"name":"HUANG GAOMINqwwq","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c